                <p>Source: National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, Central Files 1967-69, DEF 1 UK. Confidential. Drafted by Judd and approved in U on July 24.
                    The memorandum is Part 1 of 3. The meeting was held in Katzenbach’s office.</p>
            </note>
